SUMMARY:PLAYISM Game Show: TGS 2026 Preview
DESCRIPTION:PLAYISM will host the “PLAYISM Game Show: Tokyo Game Show 2026 Preview” live stream on September 10 at 3:30 a.m. PT / 6:30 a.m. ET / 19:30 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Niconico. \nThe 10-minute broadcast will unveil PLAYISM’s full lineup of 11 titles to be exhibited at Tokyo Game Show 2026\, including titles being announced for the first time. After the main broadcast\, the presenters will demonstrate each title on stream. Presenters include hosts Neki Matsuzawa and Shunji Mizutani (PLAYISM)\, and guests Kirin and Shuhei Yoshida.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/playism-game-show-tgs-2026-preview
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_PLAYISM-Game-Show_09-10-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
