SUMMARY:Aniplex One Focus 2026
DESCRIPTION:Aniplex will host Aniplex One Focus 2026 on September 12 at 18:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature newly unveiled information on various anime\, games\, and movies. It will focus primarily on anime premiering in October\, while also spotlighting movies\, titles due out in 2027 and beyond\, and games. \nFeatured titles include: \nA Returner’s Magic Should Be SpecialBeast King War God DandivineEven the Student Council Has Its Holes!Expelled from Paradise: Resonance from the HeartFall in Love\, You False AngelsFate/EXTRA RecordGROTESQQQUEThe Guy She Was Interested in Wasn’t a Guy at AllInherit the WindsMagical ExplorerMelty Blood: Twi-LuminaPlease Excuse My Younger BrothersPressPuella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie -Walpurgisnacht Rising-Rascal Does Not Dream of a Dear Friend (anime movie)Reborn as a Space Mercenary: I Woke Up Piloting the Strongest Starship!RilakkumaVertex ForceWitch on the Holy Night (anime movie)And more!
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/aniplex-one-focus-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_AOF_09-12-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
